validation/hybrid_scaling_strouhal_validation.md
# Hybrid MPI+CUDA Strouhal Validation Results

Validation target: `St ≈ 0.16` at `Re = 100`.

This validation checks the same configurations used in the hybrid scaling report.
It keeps the physical Reynolds-number setup fixed and verifies that each
rank/halo/grid configuration still recovers the expected vortex-shedding
frequency.

For timing-only scaling, use `EVERY=0`, `PROBE=/dev/null`, and
`PROBE_EVERY=0`. This script instead writes probe CSV files with
`PROBE_EVERY=1` so that the Strouhal number can be computed.

